60	     single --fs-small — the quiet stuff stays quiet via opacity/color, not via
61	     a barely-smaller font. Two literals are intentional exceptions: inline
62	     `code` in a summary uses 0.86em (relative, so it tracks its container) and
63	     the close button uses line-height:1 (glyph centering, not a text measure). */
64	  --fs-small:   12px;  /* everything glanceable, not read: badges, keys, chips, gutter,
